<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe sugar tender result not made public.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe sugar tender result not made public.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chief executive of Zimbabwe Sugar Refinery, Stanley Musesengwa, said on Monday the result of a tender to buy 28,000 tonnes of raw sugar for delivery in January and February would not be made public.</p>
<p>&quot;It's not an open tender in the true sense.</p>
<p>&quot;The result will only made available to those who placed their tenders,&quot; he told Reuters ahead of the result which was due around 1545 (1345 GMT) on Monday.</p>
<p>He declined to elaborate. --Harare Newsroom +263-4 72 52 27/8/9</p>
